# React Structure

## Directory roles

| Directory | Use for |
|-----------|---------|
| `src/screens/` | Full-page route targets — one screen per learner step |
| `src/components/` | Reusable UI shared across screens (frames, quiz widgets, nav) |
| `src/store/` | Session hook + browser persistence (`useSessionStore`, `sessionStorage`) |
| `src/context/` | Cross-cutting providers (e.g. `ConfirmContext`) |
| `src/lib/` | Pure logic — scoring, DB, gates (no JSX) |

## Screens

- Lazy-import in `App.jsx`; register path in `<Routes>`
- Accept `session` prop from `useSessionStore()` — do not instantiate a second store
- Call DB helpers from `src/lib/db.js` on milestone completion (pre/post test, lesson complete)
- Use `recordScreenEnter` / `recordScreenExit` for timed screens

## Components

- Presentational or lightly stateful — no route definitions
- Session gating lives in `RequireSessionStep`, not individual screens
- Prefer existing parchment/frame/skeleton components before new layout primitives

## Patterns

- Functional components + hooks only (React 19)
- ESM imports with `.js` extensions where the repo already uses them
- GitHub Pages base path: link with React Router, not hardcoded absolute paths without basename
